WHAT THIS COVERS

  data/llm-releases.json, and the api/*.json and llm-releases.csv exports
  generated from it.

WHAT THIS DOES NOT COVER

  The linked sources themselves. Each record cites the provider's own
  announcement, paper or model card; those pages belong to their publishers
  and are linked, not reproduced.

  Company names, logos and model names are trademarks of their respective
  owners and are used here to identify the releases being catalogued.

ACCURACY

  Records carry a provenance status (verified, partially_verified,
  unverified, conflicting, estimated) and a confidence score. "Verified"
  means a primary source was checked. Undisclosed figures are recorded as
  null rather than estimated. The dataset is offered as-is, with no warranty
  of accuracy or completeness — check the cited source before relying on any
  individual figure.
